  "description": "Official .NET client for iSigner — Nepal's national digital signature platform.\n      Sign PDFs (single, batch, institutional bulk), validate signatures, manage citizen\n      sessions. Talks to the iSigner gateway (client HMAC) or directly to the signing\n      agent (ServiceAuth). Works on .NET Framework 4.5+, .NET Standard 2.0, and .NET 8.\n      No PDF download/upload — signing happens server-side.",
